@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### ==========================================================
### TPI Food Store — Autenticación (JWT en cookie HttpOnly)
### REST Client guarda la cookie access_token y la reenvía sola.
### Ejecutar en orden. Antes: python -m app.db.seed
### ==========================================================


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### REGISTRO
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Registrar un cliente (201 UserPublic, role = "user", sin hashed_password)
# @name registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juan{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
  "full_name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}@mail.com",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### 2. Registrar con username existente (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "full_name": "Otro Admin",
  "email": "otro@mail.com",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### 3. Registrar con email existente (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nuevo{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
  "full_name": "Nuevo",
  "email": "admin@foodstore.com",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### 4. Password de menos de 8 caracteres (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "corto",
  "full_name": "Corto",
  "email": "corto@mail.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 5. Email inválido (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "malmail",
  "full_name": "Mal Mail",
  "email": "esto-no-es-un-email",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### LOGIN / ME / LOGOUT
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 6. /me sin sesión (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 7. Login con contraseña incorrecta (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=incorrecta

### 8. Login con usuario inexistente (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=no-existe&password=Secreta123

### 9. Login del usuario registrado en 1 (200 { "message": "Login exitoso" })
# Mirar el header Set-Cookie: access_token=...; HttpOnly; Max-Age=1800; SameSite=lax
# El cuerpo NO incluye el token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{registro.response.body.username}}&password=Secreta123

### 10. Perfil del usuario de la sesión (200 UserPublic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 11. Logout (200, borra la cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 12. /me después del logout (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 13. Login del admin del seed (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=Admin1234!

### 14. /me del admin (200, role = "admin")
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
